OL,3,GNEWSAUS officer sentenced for road
OL,4,Adeath of couple
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serving US Air Force officer who
OL,7,Fkilled a couple in a road crash has
OL,8,Fbeen handed a suspended sentence.
OL,10,FJasmine Dessaure, 37, of Linden Walk,
OL,11,FBeck Row, Suffolk, pleaded guilty to
OL,12,Ftwo counts of causing death by careless
OL,13,Fdriving at a previous hearing.
OL,15,FShe had been driving on the B1106 near
OL,16,FBrandon on 15 April 2023, when she
OL,17,Fswerved on to the wrong side of the
OL,18,Froad, Peterborough Crown Court heard on
OL,19,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
